// Parameters are NOT written here: they come from `generated::shaders`, which the
// manifest generates. Upstream's `AddAliasTests` loop over
// (case table x Synchronization x Function x LayoutFlags) is baked into the manifest
// rather than kept as a Rust loop, because unlike the zero-initialize group every one
// of those axes changes the emitted GLSL - so each combination is its own shader and
// its own manifest entry, and all this file does is register them in that same order.

